  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing the Women, Peace and Security Agenda in Lebanon through Building Pathways for Dialogue and Inclusive Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to initiate and support two tracks of dialogues within the women involved in mainstream political parties and women engaged in the protest movements, with the aim of building trust and consensus in Lebanon around policy options and important reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
